        "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
        "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Our first donation of 100 Emergency Relief Beds is headed to Honduras to help triage patients and lessen the burden on the area hospitals during the COVID-19 crisis.</span>",
